- SulAmérica health and dental plan extended to dependents;
- Food/meal allowance on Caju flexible benefits card
- Life insurance;
- Home office allowance on Caju flexible benefits card;
- Wellhub (Gympass);
- Sesc – extended to dependents, with access to services across Brazil;
- TotalPass.

_For your development:_

- ília University: Corporate university with more than 20 thousand courses available for personal and professional development;
- Language Academy: Language school for ílians;
- í-talks and Chapter: Moments and ceremonies where the team shares practices, studies, projects and ideas. Chapters also bring together people with similar skills to share ideas, practices and experiences;

