Experience with CI/CD pipelines, particularly using Jenkins.

It will be a plus:

Experience with Angular 15+;

Experience with Spark (Python or Scala);

Knowledge of analytics tools, such as Adobe Analytics;

Familiarity with big data solutions, including Data Lake, Data Warehouse, ETL, BI, Data Mesh, MLOps, among others.

